    "enUS": {
      "description": "Thank you for rescuing me! We must leave quickly before they discover that I am free. Please escort me to Camp Aparaje. From there, I know my way.\n\nMy father, Makaba Flathoof, will be desperate to know that I am safe.",
      "eventObjectiveLabel": "Kaya Escorted to Camp Aparaje",
      "summary": "Escort Kaya Flathoof to Camp Aparaje, and then return to Makaba Flathoof near the southeastern edge of Stonetalon.\n",
      "title": "Protect Kaya",
